# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — CMake 项目无 install() 规则 → conan package() 手工收集 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-10-04
# Software: yabause 0.9.15
# Gate: W3/package
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id: DRAFT-yabause-cmake-no-install-rules-manual-package
severity: 3
category: packaging|conan|cmake
trigger_tool: conan|cmake
phase: package
approach: conanfile.py 的 package() 用 conan.tools.files.copy 手工收集构建产物（lib/*.a）与源码头文件（include/ 保留子目录结构），includedirs 指向对应层级；无 install 目标时勿用 cmake.install()

keywords: make install, install(), CMake, no rule, conan package, copy, libyabause, static library

error_signature: make: \*\*\* No rule to make target 'install'|No install\(\) rules|cmake install.*No available|install target.*not exist
match_keywords: no rule to make target,install,cmake,package,manual,copy

root_cause: 上游 CMake 项目只定义 add_library 而未注册任何 install(TARGETS/FILES) 规则
  （部分 l10n 安装逻辑还包在 if(UNIX AND NOT APPLE) 里，HarmonyOS 不命中）；make install
  无目标。conanfile 使用 cmake.install() 会静默产出空包
affected_scope: 仅提供库目标、无 install 规则的 CMake 项目在 conan 化时交付空包
